<title>BRAZIL: Brazil non-ferrous metals - November statistics.</title>
<headline>Brazil non-ferrous metals - November statistics.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Production in November 1996 and consumption, imports and exports of Brazilian non-ferrous metals in January/November 1996 compared with 1995 were as follows, said Secretariat of Mines and Metallurgy.</p>
<p>All figures are in tonnes.</p>
<p>   METAL	    PRODUCTION (NOV)	 CONSUMPTION (JAN/NOV)</p>
<p>			  1996	 1995	    1996	 1995</p>
<p> Aluminium	   98,400     98,000	 649,628    449,408</p>
<p> Lead			 0	  832	     n/a     60,523</p>
<p> Copper		 9,785     16,026	 212,439    187,071</p>
<p> Tin		    1,451	1,489	   5,380	5,284</p>
<p> Magnesium		n/a	  n/a	     n/a	  n/a</p>
<p> Nickel		 1,456	1,077	  18,037     17,234</p>
<p> Zinc		  13,964     16,045	 121,321    169,037</p>
<p>METAL		 EXPORTS (JAN/NOV)	  IMPORTS (JAN/NOV)</p>
<p>			  1996	 1995	    1996	 1995</p>
<p> Aluminium	  549,977    742,424	  79,747     93,867</p>
<p> Lead		   1,518	2,430	  34,708     46,620</p>
<p> Copper		58,978     62,609	 141,082    150,315</p>
<p> Tin		   10,841	9,212		66	  160</p>
<p> Magnesium	    1,342	  450	   2,517	3,015</p>
<p> Nickel		 5,282	4,230	   8,714	7,312</p>
<p> Zinc		  48,527     47,277	   5,428     38,277</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
